WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
OPORD/01-2019 starts CMDB and dynamic discovery. An enterprise platform reaches DPE and DSE by June 2022.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Configuration Management processes are established, including ICT System Modelling.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
DSR: HICTO orders 66 and 67 assess about 87 critical ICT Systems against 28 compliance questions. TSAAT v1.0 reports the findings.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
DIIS captures ICT System inventory and ownership. OMWOW models about 3,000 systems. TSAAT v2.0 and training arrive in Q4 2025.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
TSAAT is presented to DSOC and Cyber Command as a reporting tool for visibility of the Cyber Terrain.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
TSAAT v3.0 is designed in Q4 2026 for DSOC needs, with delivery planned for January 2027.
